  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Cook opt 01 \u2014 generators, still vs live\n\nOpen this patch. A window titled \"01 generators\" should appear.\nGrid is left to right, top row then bottom row.\n\n1 NoiseTOP time_offset = 2.5. STILL noise. Not black.\n2 NoiseTOP time_offset = time. The pattern SCROLLS.\n3 Voronoi speed 0. STILL cells.\n4 Voronoi speed 2. Cells MOVE.\n5 Ripple speed 0 on a yellow circle. STILL.\n6 Ripple speed 8. The circle WARPS and keeps moving.\n7 Scan lines, jitter 0. STILL stripes on the circle.\n8 Scan lines, jitter 8. Stripes SHIMMER.\n\nFail if a \"still\" cell moves, a \"live\" cell is frozen, or any cell is black.",
      "position": [
        -40,
        -280
      ],
      "size": [
        720,
        280
      ],
      "color": [
        1.0,
        0.95,
        0.55,
        0.92
      ]
    }
  ]
